{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/salva-emaar-properties-the-heights","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1390,"crm_id":"7447","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Salva","slug":"salva-emaar-properties-the-heights","display_address":"The Heights Country Club and Wellness","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"2030","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":6500000,"display_price":"6.5M","lattitude":24.976298935478,"longitude":55.253680503093,"min_bedrooms":3,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Salva at The Heights Country Club &amp; Wellness introduces a villa-only residential setting where architecture, landscape, and lifestyle are seamlessly integrated. The development comprises <strong>3, 4 and 5-bedroom villas</strong> arranged across a green master plan, with each home benefiting from ample built-up areas and private outdoor spaces. The community layout promotes movement, restoration, and privacy, positioning the project as a distinctive residential offering within Emaar’s broader portfolio.</p><p>Salva at The Heights' amenities include wellness facilities, sports courts, pools, children’s play areas, and landscaped communal zones designed to support family-oriented living. Planned with long-term residency in mind, Salva Dubai luxury residences combine functional layouts with a calm, nature-forward environment, making the project particularly suited to end-users and investors focused on stable appreciation rather than short-term speculation.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_59b694c9a0.jpg","hash":"Feature_59b694c9a0","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_5aa60fb6a5.jpg","hash":"Banner_5aa60fb6a5","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-p