 target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-emaar-properties/\">Emaar Properties</a> for sale is structured around wellness, with integrated outdoor fitness areas, landscaped trails, and dedicated wellness facilities shaping everyday living.</li><li>Diverse Unit Configuration - A balanced mix of 3, 4, and 5-bedroom villas caters to different buyer profiles, from growing families to buyers seeking larger plot sizes and built-up areas.</li><li>Generous Plot and Built-Up Areas - Salva in The Heights Country Club is designed with spacious layouts and private outdoor areas, supporting both lifestyle appeal and long-term asset value.</li><li>Integrated Community Amenities - Sports courts, community centers, pools, and a mosque are incorporated within the master plan, reducing reliance on external infrastructure.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2014,"cta":{"id":2844,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/location_076254b136.jpg","hash":"location_076254b136","name":"location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Easy Access to Dubai’s Major Road Network","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Salva is located within the master development, The Heights. It is close to well-established destinations such as Dubai Hills Estate and Arabian Ranches, two of Dubai’s most recognized master-planned communities. The location benefits from direct access to major road networks, allowing residents to reach key lifestyle and commercial hubs with ease while remaining within a calm, low-density residential environment.</p><ul><li>10 minutes to Expo City</li><li>10 minutes to Al Maktoum International Airport</li><li>15 minutes to Dubai South</li><li>20 minutes to Dubai Hills Estate</li><li>30 minutes Downtown Dubai</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":null,"video_module":{"id":3456,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":4582,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Villa","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":4583,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"4 Bedroom Villa","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":4584,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"5 Bedroom Villa","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"80/20","payment_plans":[{"id":12943,"title":"10%","description":"Down Payment"},{"id":12944,"title":"70%","description":"During Construction"},{"id":12951,"title":"20%","description":"On Handover"}],"community":"The Heights Country Club and Wellness","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":35810,"url":null,"text":"Wellness Centre & Clubhouse","type":null,"image":null},{"id":35811,"url":null,"text":"Outdoor Fitness Areas","type":null,"image":null},{"id":35812,"url":null,"text":"Nature Trails","type":null,"image":null},{"id":35813,"url":null,"text":"Community Pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":35814,"url":null,"text":"Kids Pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":35815,"url":null,"text":"Sports Courts","type":null,"image":null},{"id":35816,"url":null,"text":"Community Center","type":null,"image":null},{"id":35817,"url":null,"text":"Farm-to-Table Café","type":null,"image":null}],"bitrix":{"id":1427,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":null,"tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Salva","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":" The Heights Country Club & Wellness"},"banner_image_mobile":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Mobile_67611e3a50.jpg","hash":"Mobile_67611e3a50","name":"Mobile.jpg"},"seo